Provides: visual-studio-codium
Conflicts: visual-studio-codium
Replaces: visual-studio-codium
Description: Code editing. Redefined. (VSCodium build)
 VSCodium is a community build of Microsoft's Visual Studio Code, produced from
 the free/open-source sources with Microsoft's branding, telemetry and
 marketplace endpoints removed.
 .
 This package is built for UOS 25 (snipe). Unlike the upstream package it does
 not register Microsoft's apt repository in its postinst, which is unreachable
 from a UOS network and would otherwise break every subsequent `apt update`.
 .
 The dependency list is the one produced by the upstream build's dependency
 generator, checked against the UOS 25 archive.
